@startuml payment-state
title WF-06 | PaymentStatus
hide empty description
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> PENDING : create paid checkout / persist payment
PENDING --> PAID : apply [verified paid outcome, subscription pending (BR-66)]\n/ activate subscription
PENDING --> FAILED : apply [verified final failure or checkout expired]\n/ cancel pending subscription
PAID --> REFUNDED : complete [refund confirmed] / record refund
FAILED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of PAID
  Matching callback replay returns the current result (BR-67).
  The payment remains PAID while the refund is being reviewed or processed.
end note
@enduml
